irst textured frame: pixel analysis plus READ frames. Extra cross-checks: map_showcase and map_legibility headless (RESULT ok), map_fps windowed (draw_calls_max 257, 120 fps steady), four windowed frames with all four Unit types in both Team colours READ. No defect found, so issues is empty. Not covered: the camera-ray visibility proof and the author-judgement frames (other lenses), real key events through the Round on the real SplitScreen for the rise (probe copy used instead), code-standards review and lint007.py (code lens). Recorded, not flagged: a Gyrocopter teleported onto a ridge is inside rock for 7 ticks (the class doc's stated exception, unreachable in a Round); the model rises to 2.27 m when standing within 2 m of rock (the design's margin); the first frame costs about 260 ms plus 254 ms of _ready (the nine textures and the four kit builds, once, behind the Round's start)."}
